<title>USA: Immune Response Phase II trial positive.</title>
<headline>Immune Response Phase II trial positive.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Immune Response Corp said Tuesday results from a Phase II clinical trial for its proprietary immune-based therapy for rheumatoid arthritis were positive.</p>
</text>
